pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black">&nbsp;A landlord
 shall not enter a rental unit occupied by a tenant under a tenancy agreeme=
nt except where</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:6.0pt;=
margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:54.0pt;text-align:justify;background:#FDFEF=
E">
<span style=3D"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;co=
lor:black">(a)&nbsp;an emergency exists and entry to the rental unit is nec=
essary;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:6.0pt;=
margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:54.0pt;text-align:justify;background:#FDFEF=
E">
<span style=3D"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;co=
lor:black">(b)&nbsp;the tenant consents to the entry;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:6.0pt;=
margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:54.0pt;text-align:justify;background:#FDFEF=
E">
<span style=3D"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;co=
lor:black">(c)&nbsp;the landlord shows the rental unit to a prospective ten=
ant after notice of termination is given under this Act but before the tena=
nt has vacated the unit;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:6.0pt;=
margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:54.0pt;text-align:justify;background:#FDFEF=
E">
<span style=3D"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;co=
lor:black">(d)&nbsp;the landlord inspects the rental unit on the day the te=
nant is required to vacate the unit to complete a rental unit condition rep=
ort or to determine if the tenant has fulfilled the
 tenant's obligations under this Act and the tenancy agreement, and the ins=
pection takes place at a reasonable time;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:6.0pt;=
margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:54.0pt;text-align:justify;background:#FDFEF=
E">
<span style=3D"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;co=
lor:black">(e)&nbsp;the landlord in good faith believes that the rental uni=
t has been abandoned by the tenant and gives written notice to the tenant i=
n accordance with subsection&nbsp;(2);</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:6.0pt;=
margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:54.0pt;text-align:justify;background:#FDFEF=
E">
<span style=3D"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;co=
lor:black">(f)&nbsp;the landlord gives written notice in accordance with su=
