E">
<span style=3D"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;co=
lor:black">(iii)&nbsp;to permit a mortgagee or insurer or prospective mortg=
agee or insurer to inspect the unit when a mortgage or insurance coverage i=
s being arranged or renewed on the residential complex,
